{"q":"345","t":"Reverse Vowels of a String","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a string <code>s</code>, reverse only all the vowels in the string and return it.</p>\n\n<p>The vowels are <code>&#39;a&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;e&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;i&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;o&#39;</code>, and <code>&#39;u&#39;</code>, and they can appear in both lower and upper cases, more than once.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">s = &quot;IceCreAm&quot;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">&quot;AceCreIm&quot;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The vowels in <code>s</code> are <code>[&#39;I&#39;, &#39;e&#39;, &#39;e&#39;, &#39;A&#39;]</code>. On reversing the vowels, s becomes <code>&quot;AceCreIm&quot;</code>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">s = &quot;leetcode&quot;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">&quot;leotcede&quot;</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 3 * 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>s</code> consist of <strong>printable ASCII</strong> characters.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{ \r\n  \"name\": \"reverseVowels\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    { \r\n      \"name\": \"s\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"string\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Two Pointers","slug":"two-pointers"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"}],"s":[{"t":"Reverse String","s":"reverse-string","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Remove Vowels from a String","s":"remove-vowels-from-a-string","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Faulty Keyboard","s":"faulty-keyboard","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Sort Vowels in a String","s":"sort-vowels-in-a-string","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Meta","facebook"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Oracle","oracle"],["EPAM Systems","epam-systems"],["Apple","apple"],["Uber","uber"],["Visa","visa"],["Twitch","twitch"]],"cs":{"a":[["Google","google",5],["Microsoft","microsoft",3],["Amazon","amazon",3],["Meta","facebook",2],["tcs","tcs",2]],"b":[],"m":[["Bloomberg","bloomberg",18],["Oracle","oracle",6],["EPAM Systems","epam-systems",3],["Apple","apple",2],["Zoho","zoho",2],["Visa","visa",2],["Twitch","twitch",2]]}}